1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Your commentator is Joel Bryant.
解说员：乔尔·布莱恩特

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:12,500
Here is the motion picture record released by the United States Navy
以下是美国海军发布的影像记录

3
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:19,000
of the havoc wrought by the Japs' sneak sky and sea raid
记录了日军对美国海军要塞发动的空中与海上偷袭

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:23,500
on Pearl Harbor — America's mid-Pacific Naval bastion.
目标是珍珠港——美国在太平洋中部的海军要塞

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:30,000
On December 7th, 1941, Japan, like its infamous Axis partners,
1941 年 12 月 7 日，日本与其臭名昭著的轴心国同伙一样

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
struck first and declared war afterwards.
先动手，事后才宣战

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Costly to our Navy was the loss of war vessels, airplanes, and equipment.
我们的海军付出沉重代价——战舰、飞机与装备尽失

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
But more costly to Japan was the effectiveness of its foul attack in immediately unifying America…
但日本付出的代价更大——这场卑劣偷袭立刻让整个美国上下一心……
